ninfer-serve: --prefill-chunk must be a positive multiple of 128
usage: D:\BaiduNetdiskDownload\Local-AI\_tools\ninfer-build\apps\ninfer-serve.exe <model.ninfer> [--host H] [--port N] [--api-key KEY] [--model-id ID] [--max-context N] [--kv-capacity N|auto] [--max-concurrency N] [--max-pending-requests N] [--pending-timeout-ms N] [--prefill-chunk N] [--log-stats-interval-ms N] [--device N] [--context-cost-presets FILE] [--max-request-mib N] [--media-cache-mib N] [--media-live-mib N] [--media-preprocess-threads N] [--device-state-slots N] [--host-context-mib N] [--request-log-jsonl FILE] [--response-store-max-records N] [--response-store-max-mib N] [--kv-dtype bf16|int8|fp8|nvfp4|k8v4] [--spec mtp|dflash|dflash2 --draft-tokens N] [--default-max-tokens N] [--default-thinking-budget N] [--vision] [--no-cuda-graph] [--no-prefix-reuse] [--chat-template FILE] [--lm-head-draft] [--no-thinking] [--preserve-thinking] [--cors] [--temperature F] [--top-p F] [--top-k N] [--min-p F] [--presence-penalty F] [--frequency-penalty F] [--seed N] [--greedy]
       [--log-level trace|debug|info|warning|error|critical|off]
       serves OpenAI Responses/Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages endpoints
       --default-max-tokens defaults to 8192 when omitted
       --max-request-mib defaults to 384 and is enforced before JSON parsing
       --media-cache-mib defaults to 1024; 0 disables retained media reuse
       --media-live-mib defaults to 2048 and bounds all live BF16 patch payloads
       --media-preprocess-threads defaults to 0 (auto, at most 16 workers)
       --request-log-jsonl appends full-precision server/request records
       --model-id overrides the artifact metadata.name reported by the server
       Responses state is process-local and bounded to 1024 records / 256 MiB by default
       --log-stats-interval-ms defaults to 5000; 0 disables periodic throughput logs
       --vision enables media and loads the fixed Vision GPU allocations
       --prefill-chunk requires a positive multiple of 128; defaults to 1024, or 4096 with CPU expert offload
       startup uses 1024 MiB of planning headroom for both explicit and automatic KV capacity
       --no-prefix-reuse disables cross-request history; request pause/replay resources remain available
       context defaults: device-state=max-concurrency; Host budget is resolved from 8192 MiB plus eight native StateImages
       --device-state-slots is extra capacity beyond active lanes; --host-context-mib bounds shared Host State/KV and in-flight storage in MiB
       --host-context-mib accepts decimal MiB values that resolve to whole bytes
       --default-thinking-budget caps model-origin thinking for enabled requests; control tokens count toward the request output limit
       --preserve-thinking retains closed-turn assistant reasoning in later prompts
       sampler defaults come from the loaded model and resolved thinking mode; server flags and request fields override individual values.
       --greedy forces temperature 0 (exact argmax).
